        "summary": "Delete a variant set",
        "description": "Use this resource to delete variant set by id. Offers included in variant set will not be stopped or modified by this operation. Read more: <a href=\"../../tutorials/jak-utworzyc-oferte-wielowariantowa-oA6ZYBg5XFo#usun-oferte-wielowariantowa\" target=\"_blank\">PL</a> / <a href=\"../../tutorials/how-to-create-a-multi-variant-offer-nn9DOL3nXs2#remove-a-multi-variant-offer\" target=\"_blank\">EN</a>.",
        "deprecated": true,
