        "description": "Use this resource to post a message in certain issue. At least one of fields: 'text', 'attachment' has to be present. Read more: <a href=\"../../tutorials/jak-zarzadzac-dyskusjami-E7Zj6gK7ysE#nowa-wiadomosc-w-dyskusji-lub-reklamacji\" target=\"_blank\">PL</a> / <a href=\"../../tutorials/how-to-manage-discussions-VL6Yr40e5t5#new-message-in-dispute-or-claim\" target=\"_blank\">EN</a>.",
        "operationId": "addMessageToIssueUsingPOST",
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created",
            "content": {
              "application/vnd.allegro.beta.v1+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PostPurchaseIssueMessage"
                },
                "examples": {
